## Monitor stubs

No `lockdown`/`reboot` modules. Unknown paths → **404** (reject, not 200 no-op). If product surface names them: register `POST /lockdown` + `POST /reboot` → **501/403** `{error:{type:'not_implemented'}}`, never empty success.

## CORS

Allowlist via `cors_origins` (`gateway.mjs:52-60`). Manifest uses `http://localhost` / `http://127.0.0.1` without ports → browsers with `:port` Origin usually get no ACAO (safe). Keep exact; no `*`.

## Looks fine

Public bind needs API key + `GREEN_ROOMZ_ALLOW_PUBLIC=1`. Body size limit. `secureEquals` auth. Mixed image+audio `ValidationError`. Session identity check when keyed.

